OL,3,GNEWSAWorkers rights reforms will not
OL,4,Ahappen before next election
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major package of reforms to workers'
OL,7,Frights in Northern Ireland will not
OL,8,Fhappen before next year's Assembly
OL,9,Felection.
OL,11,FThe Good Jobs Bill was first announced
OL,12,Falmost two years ago.
OL,14,FIt was the main piece of legislation
OL,15,Fbeing brought forward by the Sinn Fein
OL,16,FEconomy Minister, Caoimhe Archibald.
OL,18,FThe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,19,Fopposed elements of the draft bill and
OL,20,Frefused to allow it to be debated by
OL,21,Fthe Assembly.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
